* Battery monitor analog front-end
* --- 1) Voltage divider ---
Vbat vbat 0 12.6
R1 vbat adc0 30k
R2 adc0 0 10k
C1 adc0 0 100n

* --- 2) NTC divider (Beta model, B=3950) ---
.param Tc=25
V3v3 v3v3 0 3.3
Rref v3v3 adc4 10k
Rntc adc4 0 R={10k*exp(3950*(1/(Tc+273.15)-1/298.15))}

* --- 3) Relay driver ---
V5 v5 0 5
Vpc0 pc0 0 PULSE(0 3.3 10m 1u 1u 40m 100m)
Rb pc0 base 1k
Rcoil v5 n1 70
Lcoil n1 coll 100m
D1 coll v5 D1N4007
Q1 coll base 0 Q2N2222

.model D1N4007 D(IS=76.9p RS=42m N=1.45 BV=1000 IBV=5u CJO=26.5p M=0.333 TT=4.32u)
.model Q2N2222 NPN(IS=14.34f BF=255.9 VAF=74.03 IKF=0.2847 NE=1.307 ISE=14.34f BR=6.092 RB=10 RC=1 CJE=22.01p CJC=7.306p TF=411.1p TR=46.91n)

.tran 150m
.end